      "message": "If duration \u003d\u003d 0, we would still skip msleep (and only \u0027release\u0027 would be executed). So, I think we still need to do something...\n\nEither 1. we reject (no-op) a call with duration \u003d\u003d 0, or 2. make the first call immediate (calling power_button_change_deferred without hook_call_deferred) or 3. check ms \u003c\u003d 0 in command_powerbtn.\n\n#2 is ideal if it works. #1 is not ideal because failure is silent. #3 isn\u0027t ideal because power_button_simulate_press itself isn\u0027t fixed.",
